name: Wee Joker — 2-card chip scaling
author: corpus
description: >-
  Wee Joker gains +8 Chips when each played 2 is scored. First-shop 2-chip engine: pair
  with Hack (retrigger 2s), Seltzer, and a deck full of 2s.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - joker: WeeJoker
    antes: [1]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0, 1, 2, 3]
      boosterPacks: [0, 1]
should:
  - joker: Hack
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - joker: Seltzer
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 35
  - joker: DNA
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 25
